    <description>没有据点、没有旗帜的走私网络。黑网的商人偶尔会出现在殖民地门口，卖奴隶、毒药和来路不明的货，也收器官、巨魔血和夺心魔的东西——价钱永远对他们有利。</description>
    <pawnSingular>黑网商人</pawnSingular>
    <pawnsPlural>黑网商人</pawnsPlural>
    <techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
    <hidden>true</hidden>
    <displayInFactionSelection>false</displayInFactionSelection>
    <settlementGenerationWeight>0</settlementGenerationWeight>
    <canStageAttacks>false</canStageAttacks>
    <raidsForbidden>true</raidsForbidden>
    <canGenerateQuestSites>false</canGenerateQuestSites>
    <rescueesCanJoin>false</rescueesCanJoin>
    <factionIconPath>Factions/BlackNetwork</factionIconPath>
    <colorSpectrum>
      <li>(0.26, 0.30, 0.30)</li>
      <li>(0.34, 0.38, 0.36)</li>
    </colorSpectrum>
    <basicMemberKind>LP_BN_Enforcer</basicMemberKind>
    <ideoName>价钱</ideoName>
    <ideoDescription>一切都有价钱。</ideoDescription>
    <forcedMemes>
      <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Ideology">Structure_Ideological</li>
